{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slingshot Quest</strong> is an RPG with turn-based combat, set in a fantasy world where a war between species wages on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Save The World. Slay The Dragon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Charlie</strong>, a Slingshot-user unsatisfied with his role as a healer. Your short trip to rescue your bird companion quickly turns into an ambitious quest to save the world, together with a rag-tag team of fellow fighters you meet along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet Unlikely Friends. Strengthen Your Bonds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a close bond with four quirky allies, transcending the conflicts between species to work towards a common goal. Manage your party's stats and equipment, levelling them up after each thrilling fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Dangerous Dungeons. Push Beyond Your Limits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Working your way up from barely surviving in an abandoned, small fortress to conquering the lairs of the <strong>Void Dragon</strong> Itself, you'll see yourself growing stronger and more capable with every battle won.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master The Combat. Master the Slingshot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slingshot Quest uses a <strong>turn-based</strong> battle system, inspired by classic JRPGs. On your turn, you can choose to cast a spell, attack an enemy, use an item, defend, unleash a powerful SUPER move, or attempt to escape. Combat features a <strong>quick-time</strong> event minigame for attacks. When using spells or items, you'll need to carefully <strong>aim</strong> to hit as many targets at once and deal as much damage as possible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711230?t=1746212257","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/de7770e8cf095a54feae5929e6e7c0fe620aead8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746212257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/60de737351a877307215bda822ce462688b74220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746212257","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/60de737351a877307215bda822ce462688b74220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746212257","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slingshot Quest</strong> is an RPG with turn-based combat, set in a fantasy world where a war between species wages on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Save The World. Slay The Dragon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Charlie</strong>, a Slingshot-user unsatisfied with his role as a healer. Your short trip to rescue your bird companion quickly turns into an ambitious quest to save the world, together with a rag-tag team of fellow fighters you meet along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet Unlikely Friends. Strengthen Your Bonds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a close bond with four quirky allies, transcending the conflicts between species to work towards a common goal. Manage your party's stats and equipment, levelling them up after each thrilling fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Dangerous Dungeons. Push Beyond Your Limits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Working your way up from barely surviving in an abandoned, small fortress to conquering the lairs of the <strong>Void Dragon</strong> Itself, you'll see yourself growing stronger and more capable with every battle won.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master The Combat. Master the Slingshot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slingshot Quest uses a <strong>turn-based</strong> battle system, inspired by classic JRPGs. On your turn, you can choose to cast a spell, attack an enemy, use an item, defend, unleash a powerful SUPER move, or attempt to escape. Combat features a <strong>quick-time</strong> event minigame for attacks. When using spells or items, you'll need to carefully <strong>aim</strong> to hit as many targets at once and deal as much damage as possible.</p>","developers":["Fowl Byte"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/65d3a9d4d5f4299ad90ca48ec5413f12e34bcc94/header.jpg?t=1746212257","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Slingshot Quest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Fowl Byte"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nConte\u00fado sexual\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSexuelle Andeutungen\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/810bab6dc490fb871095381982aab9a6a66a07da/ss_810bab6dc490fb871095381982aab9a6a66a07da.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746212257","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/810bab6dc490fb871095381982aab9a6a66a07da/ss_810bab